{
  "kind": "vuln",
  "lens": "vuln",
  "identity_rule": "漏洞的身份是 `template-id@规范化目标`（normalize.vuln_key）：目标是 normalize.vuln_target_parts 算出的规范写法（scheme 与小写主机名，显式端口，丢掉查询串、片段与 userinfo）。**身份必须带目标** —— 只用 template-id 就答不出\"命中了几个地方\"，唯一的补救是加计数器，而计数器绕开 contributions 模型、undo 之后留下幻影行。同一个模板命中不同资产是两个实体（两件事）；命中同一个目标两次算出同一个 key，管线的去重把它记成 skipped。",
  "golden": [
    "nuclei/1"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "CVE-2021-44228",
        "https://app.example.com/?token=x"
      ],
      "key": "CVE-2021-44228@https://app.example.com:443/",
      "why": "查询串被丢掉 —— 它常带一次性 token，留着会让同一个漏洞每次扫描都算成新的"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "CVE-2021-44228",
        "https://app.example.com:443/"
      ],
      "key": "CVE-2021-44228@https://app.example.com:443/",
      "why": "默认端口折叠：省略与写出来是同一个目标，不折叠就裂成两个实体"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "HTTPS://APP.Example.COM/Admin"
      ],
      "key": "https://app.example.com:443/Admin",
      "why": "scheme 与主机名折小写（DNS 不区分大小写），**路径原样保留**（路径区分大小写）"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "203.0.113.10:3389"
      ],
      "key": "203.0.113.10:3389",
      "why": "network 模板给的是 host:port，没有 scheme —— 不替 nuclei 补一个 http://"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "https://user:pw@app.example.com/x"
      ],
      "key": "https://app.example.com:443/x",
      "why": "userinfo 是凭据：既不该进身份，也不该落库（§4.5 明文凭据永不落库）"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "exposed-git-config",
        "https://app.example.com/.git/config"
      ],
      "key": "exposed-git-config@https://app.example.com:443/.git/config",
      "why": "同一个模板命中不同目标是**两个** key —— 这正是「不需要计数器」的理由"
    }
  ],
  "rejects": [
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "",
        "https://app.example.com/"
      ],
      "why": "空 template-id：模板是身份的一半，缺了它漏洞无处可挂"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "a@b",
        "https://app.example.com/"
      ],
      "why": "`@` 是身份串的分隔符，出现在 template-id 里会让两个漏洞算出同一个 key（静默合并）"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "nas"
      ],
      "why": "单标签主机不是完整域名（与 domain 这条 kind 的身份规则一致）"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "https://"
      ],
      "why": "有 scheme 但没有主机名"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.normalize_vuln_target",
      "args": [
        "http://a b/"
      ],
      "why": "目标里有空白字符"
    },
    {
      "rule": "normalize.vuln_key",
      "args": [
        "CVE-2021-44228",
        ""
      ],
      "why": "空目标：身份的另一半没了，这条记录根本不该落库"
    }
  ]
}
